WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.000
narrator: Start the embedded Headscale CLI fixture.

00:00:10.000 --> 00:00:18.000
narrator: Attempt user creation and request the user list.

00:00:28.000 --> 00:00:37.000
narrator: List nodes registered with the fixture's control plane.

00:00:40.000 --> 00:00:49.000
narrator: Request a reusable key for user ID one; verify which user that is.

00:00:52.000 --> 00:01:00.000
narrator: The next key listing selects Alice by name.

00:01:02.000 --> 00:01:11.000
narrator: Request the stored policy and inspect any reported errors.

00:01:13.000 --> 00:01:22.000
narrator: Tailnet status is an attempted admin call, not a paid-service check.

00:01:23.000 --> 00:01:28.000
narrator: Remove the fixture.
